Inferno RISC-V multi-board device plan
======================================

Machines (qemu-system-riscv64):
	virt		generic virtio + PCI ECAM + ramfb	(os/virt — primary)
	sifive_u	HiFive Unleashed / FU540		(os/sifiveu)
	sifive_e	HiFive1 / FE310-class		(future os/sifivee)
	spike		HTIF + CLINT only		(os/spike)
	microchip-icicle-kit				(future)

Shared drivers live in os/riscv/; boards supply mem.h/io.h and wire them.

Status: NEED / WIP / HAVE / N/A

Infrastructure
	A1 trap path				HAVE (per-board l.s/trap.c)
	A2 multi-hart				NEED
	A3 CLINT				HAVE
	A4 ACLINT (virt,aclint=on)		NEED
	A5 PLIC					HAVE
	A6 AIA APLIC				NEED
	A7 AIA APLIC+IMSIC			NEED
	A8 DTB / board select			WIP (hardcoded maps)
	A9 Sv39					NEED
	A10 OpenSBI S-mode boot			NEED
	A11 FPU					HAVE
	A12 PMU					OPTIONAL
	A13 syscon poweroff/reboot		NEED
	A14 sifive,test1			OPTIONAL

Consoles
	B1 NS16550 (virt)			HAVE  os/virt/uartvirt.c
	B2 SiFive UART				HAVE  os/riscv/uartsifive.c (+ os/sifiveu)
	B3 HTIF (spike)				HAVE  os/riscv/htif.c + os/spike/elf-htif-syms.py
	B4 PolarFire MMUART (icicle)		NEED

virt onboard
	C1 virtio-mmio				HAVE
	C2 fw_cfg				HAVE
	C3 ramfb				HAVE
	C4 goldfish-rtc				NEED
	C5 cfi-flash				OPTIONAL
	C6 PCI ECAM host			HAVE  os/riscv/pcivirt.c (BAR assign + pcimatch + virtio caps)
	C7 riscv-iommu-sys			OPTIONAL
	C8 ACPI					OPTIONAL

Virtio (mmio HAVE; pci net HAVE)
	D1 blk  D2 net  D3 tablet  D4 kbd  D5 rng	HAVE mmio
	D6 gpu  D7 scsi  D8 9p  D9 serial  D10 balloon
	D11 sound D12 crypto D13 iommu D14 mouse	NEED/OPTIONAL

PCI endpoints on virt
	E1 virtio-pci net			HAVE  os/virt/ethervirtiopci.c (#l0 with -device virtio-net-pci)
	E2 nvme  E3 e1000e  E4 xhci		NEED
	E5 usb funcs  E6 ahci  E7 scsi  E8 vga
	E9 sdhci-pci  E10 iommu-pci  E11 bridges

sifive_u (FU540) — no PCIe on SoC/QEMU
	F3 PRCI					NEED
	F4 SiFive UART				HAVE  serial shell smoke PASS
	F5 PWM0/1				WIP   os/riscv/pwmsifive.c (probe)
	F6 GEM					HAVE  os/riscv/ethersifivegem.c (#l0 probe; bind #l from shell)
	F7 SPI + NOR				STUB  os/riscv/spisifive.c
	F8 SPI-MMC				NEED
	F9 GPIO					NEED  os/riscv/gpiosifive.c
	F10 OTP					NEED
	F11 PDMA				STUB-OK
	F12 L2 ccache				STUB-OK

sifive_e
	G2 UART  G3 PRCI  G4 AON  G5 GPIO	NEED (reuse B2/F9)
	G6/G7 QSPI/PWM often unimplemented in QEMU

spike
	H2 HTIF					HAVE  serial shell smoke PASS (see os/spike/NOTE)

Build spike (HTIF shell smoke):
	cd os/spike
	mk SYSTARG=os OBJTYPE=riscv64 SHELLTYPE=sh INIT=spikeinit install
	./smoke.sh

icicle
	I2 MMUART  I3 GEM×2  I4 SDHC  I5 DMA	NEED
	I7 user DTB required

Build sifiveu (serial shell smoke):
	export PATH=$ROOT/MacOSX/arm64/bin:$PATH ROOT=$ROOT
	cd os/sifiveu
	mk SYSTARG=os OBJTYPE=riscv64 SHELLTYPE=sh INIT=sifiveuinit install
	./smoke.sh
